). ) One senator, Australian Democrats Senator [Andrew Bartlett](http://publicwhip-rails.openaustraliafoundation.org.au/mp.php?mpn=Andrew_Bartlett&mpc=Senate&house=senate), rebelled and crossed the floor to vote 'aye'.(Read more about what it means to cross the floor in our [FAQ Section](http://publicwhip-rails.openaustraliafoundation.org.au/faq.php#rebelandfree).) References","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-1371","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2007-08-08/4"}
